# NDS `src` conventions (ThunderCast)

**Source of truth:** `internal-context/nds-src-conventions.md` (gitignored; whole `src/` tree, not git-only). Do not dump agent rules into `src/README.md`.

## Before any src change

Audit like a reviewer: **one concern per file/folder**, no duplicate capability. Prefer MCP graph, then fix structure — no aliases forever.

## Layout

| Area | Role |
|------|------|
| `lib/` | Generic helpers (host IP, PEM markers) — no domain policy |
| `app/` | Backbone + core features: `actionHandler/`, `settingsManager/`, `session/`, `bundle/` |
| `ui/` | Shared terminal chrome only |
| `tools/` | CLI capability (`nds_pkg_*`, `nds_gh_*`, …) — no domain policy |
| `git/` | Nested: `lib/`, `access/`, `keys/`, `wizard/` |
| `install/` | Nested: `disk/` `flake/` `classic/` `nix/` `verify/` + `nixcfg/` |
| `actions/<name>/` | Single `setup.sh` — not logic/ui |
| `tests/` (src root) | Runner only |

`bundle/` lives under `app/`, not `src/bundle/`.

## File names (not actions)

Basename starts with the feature: `git_host.sh`, `bundle_paths.sh`. Forbidden: `hosts.sh`, `key.sh`, `store.sh`, `init.sh`. Exceptions: `app/main.sh`, `app/import.sh`, `app/mode.sh`, `ui/*.sh`, `settingsManager/data/builtin/<preset>.sh` (basename is the preset id), `tests/run.sh`, `tests/framework.sh`.

## Function names

`nds_<feature>_<subfeature>_<purpose>` (private: `_nds_…`, never `_git_*` / `_install_*`). App: `nds_app_<feature>_<layer>_<camelAction>`. Store: `nds_cfg_*`. Validators: `validate_<type>_<action>`. Preset hooks: `<preset>_defaults|_configure|_validate|_summary`. Logger wrappers stay `info`/`warn`/`error`.

Do not add shortcut wrappers that only call another function. Use the real name.

Generic helpers live in `lib/` (`nds_lib_getHostIP`, `nds_lib_key_bodyLooksValid`, `nds_lib_env_is_true`, `nds_lib_urandom_chars`). App backbone uses `nds_app_*`; domain features keep `nds_git_*` / `nds_install_*`. Bound-AA wrappers: `nds_feat_cfg_*` / `nds_aa_ask_*`. Indent via `nds_ui_indent_push` / `pop` — never assign `NDS_UI_INDENT_*` in a feature.

## Logic vs UI

TTY in `ui/`, work in `logic/`. Combine UI helpers used by a single sibling into that sibling file.

## Loading

`nds_import_tree`: `lib` → `logic` → `state` → `ui`, then other dirs; skip `tests/`, `data/`, `load.sh`. No nested `load.sh`.

## Tests / commit gate

```bash
bash dev/selftest.sh
bash dev/shellcheck.sh
```
